    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu aFwilistinu akwata dehi chimbaŋu chaNzambi, achifumisha dehi niku Ebenezeri, achitwala dehi nikuAshidodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "AFwilistinu atweli chimbaŋu chaNzambi, achiŋijili mwitala daDagoni, achishili kwakwihi naDagoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikunachi akwaAshidodi hiyakuhinduka budidi, nawu atali, Dagoni wadimbuka dehi chamesu hamaseki kumesu achimbaŋu chaYehova. Hiyakunona Dagoni, hiyakumusha cheŋi kwindi kwekalaŋayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikuna chicheŋi hiyakuhinduka budidi, nawu atali, Dagoni wadimbuka dehi chamesu hamaseki kumesu achimbaŋu chaYehova; namutu waDagoni nimakabu amakasindi mwayedi wawu anaketokeli dehi mwiluŋa dakuchisu, kunashali kwachipepi chaDagoni hohu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dihu hafuma ayikombeji aDagoni, hela antu enzaŋa mwitala daDagoni kubula kudata mwiluŋa dakuchisu chaDagoni muAshidodi, nikulelu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chikasa chaYehova chayilemeneni akwaAshidodi, wayijilu mwini wayikatishili natusupuhuti, niakwaAshidodi niantu akuŋinza jawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu akuAshidodi chamwenuwu ochu, elili nawu, Bayi tushakama nachimbaŋu chaNzambi yaIsarelaku; muloŋa chikasa chindi chinatulemeni naŋovu, ninetu nimukishi wetu Dagoni kumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutemesha nakupompesha tulamba twawaFwilistinu twejima, nawu enzi kudi wena, nawu, Tukwilaŋahi nachimbaŋu chaNzambi yaIsarela? Wena aakwili nawu, Chimbapu chaNzambi yaIsarela achitwali kuGati. Hiyakutwala chimbaŋu chaNzambi yaIsarela kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cheliluwu anachitwali dehi, chikasa chaNzambi hichikubabesha nankashi mukalowu; hakukatisha akwamukalowu niatwansini awakulumpi, hiyakunana nitusuŋuhuti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutemesha chimbapu chaNzambi kuEkeroni, akwaEkeroni chamwenuwu chimbaŋu chaNzambi hichikwinza kuEkeroni avwakuka nimumakumbu, nawu, Anatuleteli dehi chimbaŋu chaNzambi yaIsarela, kulonda atujahi ninetu niantu etu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakutemesha nakupompesha atulambatwa waFwilistinu twejima, nawu, Temeshenu chimbapu chaNzambi yaIsarela, chakafunti cheŋi kwachu kuchekala, chibuli kutujaha ninetu niantuetu. Muloŋa yibabesheli nankashi mwahita mukala wejima; chikasa chaNzambi chayilemeneni nankashi kwenoku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Antu abulili kufwa ayikatishilitu suŋuhuti; ikumbu damukalowu dashikili nimwiwulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
